5
00:02:01,180 --> 00:02:01,940
Qingrong.

6
00:02:04,070 --> 00:02:05,600
That wasn't what happened.

7
00:02:06,590 --> 00:02:07,590
That wasn't.

8
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:16,250
It wasn't like that.

9
00:02:16,710 --> 00:02:17,710
It really wasn't.

10
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:20,650
Listen to me.

11
00:02:20,870 --> 00:02:22,000
It wasn't like that.

12
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:29,430
How much longer are you

13
00:02:30,710 --> 00:02:32,040
going to put on this act?

14
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:41,750
Qingrong.

15
00:02:42,750 --> 00:02:43,430
Qingrong,

16
00:02:43,450 --> 00:02:44,910
please let me explain, okay?

17
00:02:44,910 --> 00:02:45,470
Enough!

18
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:54,910
Qingrong.

19
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,910
I know I was wrong.

20
00:03:00,190 --> 00:03:01,710
I deserve to die.

21
00:03:02,710 --> 00:03:04,360
Xie Shu forced me.

22
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:07,800
He forced me to kill your mother.

23
00:03:11,910 --> 00:03:14,120
I've always wanted to atone for it.

24
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:17,280
But I couldn't.

25
00:03:20,079 --> 00:03:22,310
It was impossible.

26
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:28,360
Qingrong.

27
00:03:28,910 --> 00:03:30,610
But I've treated you as my own.

28
00:03:30,750 --> 00:03:32,000
That never changed.

29
00:03:33,630 --> 00:03:36,079
I fed you and raised you myself.

30
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:38,310
Every time you were sick,

31
00:03:39,030 --> 00:03:40,960
I was right by your side.

32
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:42,470
Have you forgotten?

33
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:46,360
You know how I treat you, right?

34
00:03:47,910 --> 00:03:49,280
In this Xie Residence,

35
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:53,000
Xie Shu and Old Madam

36
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:55,770
only treated me as a stepping stone

37
00:03:57,079 --> 00:03:58,590
to climb higher.

38
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:01,560
Only you...

39
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:04,750
Only you and Qingru

40
00:04:06,150 --> 00:04:08,460
truly cared about me.

41
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:10,430
Without you two,

42
00:04:10,430 --> 00:04:11,890
I would have died long ago.

43
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:17,310
Qingrong.

44
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:19,240
You can make me

45
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:20,950
do anything.

46
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:24,930
You can make me atone for my sins.

47
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:26,360
I only beg you...

48
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,510
don't disown me,

49
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:31,480
okay?

50
00:04:33,230 --> 00:04:34,680
Don't disown me.

51
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:38,320
You raised me all these years

52
00:04:39,870 --> 00:04:41,750
and called me your child.

53
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:45,000
Is this your trick to atone for your sins,

54
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:48,800
or do you just want to see me treat
my enemy as my mother

55
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:51,390
so that you can enjoy it?

56
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:58,920
No, Qingrong.

57
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:02,000
I treat you as my own.

58
00:05:02,950 --> 00:05:04,560
My feelings for you are real.

59
00:05:05,630 --> 00:05:07,000
They never changed.

60
00:05:09,630 --> 00:05:11,240
Without you, I'd be dead.

61
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:13,070
How can I be enjoying that?

62
00:05:14,430 --> 00:05:15,680
I beg you.

63
00:05:16,270 --> 00:05:18,510
Please don't disown me, okay?

64
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:21,480
I'm begging you.

65
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:23,560
Qingrong,

66
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,430
I beg you.

67
00:05:26,750 --> 00:05:29,750
I stopped treating you
as my mother long ago.

68
00:05:38,950 --> 00:05:41,190
Do you know why you're sick?

69
00:05:47,390 --> 00:05:48,430
I know.

70
00:05:51,750 --> 00:05:53,210
I've known for a long time.

71
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:56,240
Otherwise,

72
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,680
how could I obediently

73
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:02,630
drink the medicine you fed me?

74
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:10,560
My life is yours.

75
00:06:12,630 --> 00:06:14,190
I'm giving it back to you.

76
00:06:20,950 --> 00:06:21,720
Mother!

77
00:06:36,270 --> 00:06:36,950
I...

78
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:42,600
I...

79
00:06:45,830 --> 00:06:48,290
This is just a drug
to make people lethargic.

80
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:50,820
Why is this happening?

81
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,000
Qingrong...

82
00:06:58,950 --> 00:07:00,240
Thank you.

83
00:07:03,510 --> 00:07:05,830
Thank you for the medicine you fed me.

84
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:11,430
It is the antidote of my life.

85
00:07:11,870 --> 00:07:12,630
No.

86
00:07:14,390 --> 00:07:15,160
No!

87
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:23,950
Qingrong.

88
00:07:25,270 --> 00:07:26,240
Qingrong.

89
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:48,360
This letter,

90
00:07:48,870 --> 00:07:50,680
I've hidden it for 9 years.

91
00:07:51,830 --> 00:07:54,159
It's time to return it to its owner.

92
00:07:57,310 --> 00:07:59,170
Since you already know the truth,

93
00:08:00,750 --> 00:08:02,560
why did you come to me?

94
00:08:03,830 --> 00:08:05,070
I came to you,

95
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:08,760
first, to ask you to plead with Hu Xing

96
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:10,840
to spare Shen Zhibai's life.

97
00:08:11,310 --> 00:08:12,680
He is an upright man,

98
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:14,650
and shouldn't end up like this.

99
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:17,240
Only you can do this.

100
00:08:18,870 --> 00:08:19,870
Second,

101
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:26,270
I have a letter

102
00:08:27,070 --> 00:08:29,160
that I want you to give to Lu Lingshu.

103
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:31,960
And please pass on a message:

104
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:34,870
I'd like to

105
00:08:36,870 --> 00:08:37,909
meet her.

106
00:08:45,510 --> 00:08:47,120
To tell you the truth,

107
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:50,600
after I see her,

108
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:53,270
I plan to leave Hengtang

109
00:08:53,670 --> 00:08:54,720
with my daughter,

110
00:08:55,390 --> 00:08:56,790
leaving all this behind.

111
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:59,820
Haven't you always wanted me
to go far away

112
00:08:59,900 --> 00:09:02,030
and never appear before Xie Shu again?

113
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:10,960
I've imagined countless times

114
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:14,010
how you would react
after learning the truth.

115
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:17,000
But I never expected...

116
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:21,330
that you would choose to leave.

117
00:09:24,390 --> 00:09:25,790
What I seek

118
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:27,760
is different from yours.

119
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:30,030
I never envied that mansion.

120
00:09:30,870 --> 00:09:33,730
I didn't want my daughter
to be trapped in there too,

121
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:36,030
unable to see the world outside—

122
00:09:36,750 --> 00:09:37,960
the free life.

123
00:09:40,670 --> 00:09:42,320
The secrets you want

124
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,480
are all in here.

125
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:47,480
Qingrong!

126
00:10:18,510 --> 00:10:19,390
Why?

127
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:21,600
-Why?
-Qingrong.

128
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:24,390
Qingrong.

129
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:27,390
Qingrong!

130
00:10:28,030 --> 00:10:28,870
Qingrong!

131
00:10:29,510 --> 00:10:31,600
Listen to me, Qingrong!

132
00:10:31,660 --> 00:10:33,600
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

133
00:10:36,170 --> 00:10:37,140
Qingrong!

134
00:10:37,390 --> 00:10:38,240
Qingrong!

135
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:39,840
Qingrong!

136
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:52,080
Qingrong!

137
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:54,670
Qingrong.

138
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:56,480
Qingrong.

139
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:58,700
I don't ask for your forgiveness,

140
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:01,040
or for you to acknowledge me.

141
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:02,960
I just beg you to

142
00:11:03,870 --> 00:11:05,200
leave the Xie family,

143
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:07,220
leave Xie Shu,

144
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:08,960
leave this hellhole,

145
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:11,360
and never come back to Hengtang!

146
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:14,520
What are you doing?

147
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:16,320
How disgraceful!

148
00:11:23,080 --> 00:11:24,320
Xie Shu?

149
00:11:40,390 --> 00:11:42,250
You're finally willing to see me?

150
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:46,600
You're finally willing to see me.

151
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:58,270
What's the use of seeing me now?

152
00:12:00,600 --> 00:12:02,670
You ruined my life.

153
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:06,720
I shouldn't have hated Jin Chunqing.

154
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:10,120
The one I should hate is you.

155
00:12:11,150 --> 00:12:12,150
Hu Wenzhuo,

156
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:15,120
stop speaking nonsense,

157
00:12:15,270 --> 00:12:16,730
tarnishing my innocence.

158
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:19,440
Innocence?

159
00:12:22,870 --> 00:12:24,120
Whose innocence?

160
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:26,710
You're innocent?

161
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:32,430
For you,

162
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:34,670
for your family,

163
00:12:35,550 --> 00:12:37,630
I've done evil all my life.

164
00:12:39,750 --> 00:12:40,670
Today,

165
00:12:42,670 --> 00:12:45,780
I will make it up to Qingrong.

166
00:12:49,320 --> 00:12:51,750
I will destroy you with my own hands,

167
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:56,100
and expose your most unbearable,

168
00:12:57,750 --> 00:13:00,030
most hidden secrets

169
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:02,480
to everyone.

170
00:13:02,790 --> 00:13:04,270
It's time

171
00:13:05,550 --> 00:13:07,440
the Xie family ends.

172
00:13:09,840 --> 00:13:11,670
Lord Xie,

173
00:13:12,030 --> 00:13:13,830
the patriarch of the Xie family,

174
00:13:14,270 --> 00:13:15,910
Xie Shu!

175
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:20,120
Don't tell me
you've forgotten it yourself

176
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:22,180
that you're a fake!

177
00:13:22,390 --> 00:13:25,550
You're not
the biological son of the Xie family!

178
00:13:25,550 --> 00:13:28,270
You're an impostor!

179
00:13:28,630 --> 00:13:30,040
Shut up!

180
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:46,160
Did you all hear that?

181
00:13:47,670 --> 00:13:50,320
The Xie family swapped the fake son in!

182
00:13:50,870 --> 00:13:52,300
This Xie Shu,

183
00:13:52,630 --> 00:13:55,840
is not the biological son
of the Xie family at all.

184
00:13:56,510 --> 00:13:59,550
He is an impostor!

185
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:04,890
The one who gave birth to him

186
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:08,850
was just a street gambler—

187
00:14:09,150 --> 00:14:12,960
one worse than a beggar who sold his son!

188
00:14:13,270 --> 00:14:14,660
Don't believe her!

189
00:14:15,030 --> 00:14:17,230
This shrew has gone mad!

190
00:14:47,270 --> 00:14:48,080
Mother.

191
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:51,120
Mother.

192
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:05,030
Not only did I drink it,

193
00:15:06,320 --> 00:15:07,600
but I also...

194
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:12,550
added things...

195
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,720
that worsens it.

196
00:15:19,510 --> 00:15:21,670
I wanted to untie the knot in your heart

197
00:15:22,750 --> 00:15:24,210
and repay you with my life.

198
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:30,030
Qingrong...

199
00:15:32,600 --> 00:15:33,840
I'm sorry.

200
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:36,600
I'm sorry.

201
00:15:41,780 --> 00:15:42,630
Mother...

202
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:07,550
Mother.

203
00:16:08,510 --> 00:16:10,110
What are you thinking about?

204
00:16:13,150 --> 00:16:15,720
I had a very, very long nightmare.

205
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:18,000
In the dream,

206
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:20,320
I hurt you—

207
00:16:22,440 --> 00:16:24,320
very, very deeply.

208
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:26,600
All my life,

209
00:16:27,150 --> 00:16:29,670
I lived in heart-piercing guilt.

210
00:16:30,750 --> 00:16:32,010
Until I my last breath,

211
00:16:33,480 --> 00:16:35,810
I was still begging for your forgiveness.

212
00:16:44,080 --> 00:16:45,440
In the dream,

213
00:16:45,790 --> 00:16:47,320
did you love me just as much?

214
00:16:58,910 --> 00:16:59,910
Of course.

215
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:03,200
I treated you like my own.

216
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:12,069
Then did you

217
00:17:14,270 --> 00:17:16,550
truly repent for your mistakes?

218
00:17:20,069 --> 00:17:21,310
Every moment,

219
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:26,160
I lived in the torment of regret.

220
00:17:32,750 --> 00:17:33,590
Then,

221
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:36,640
on behalf of my dream self,

222
00:17:37,880 --> 00:17:38,960
I forgive you.

223
00:17:49,070 --> 00:17:50,240
Qingrong,

224
00:17:51,480 --> 00:17:53,590
I am sorry.

225
00:17:57,510 --> 00:17:58,880
I love you.

226
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:16,270
Mother...

227
00:18:18,070 --> 00:18:19,070
Mother.

228
00:18:20,880 --> 00:18:21,880
Mother!

229
00:18:23,110 --> 00:18:24,200
Mother!

230
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:26,510
Mother.

231
00:18:29,070 --> 00:18:30,110
Mother.

232
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:34,030
Mother.

233
00:18:41,350 --> 00:18:42,400
Mother.

234
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:54,550
Your Majesty,

235
00:18:54,750 --> 00:18:56,210
the ginseng soup is ready.

236
00:18:56,270 --> 00:18:58,800
The noble families
in Hengtang are outraged.

237
00:18:59,310 --> 00:19:01,310
They demand severe punishment for Xie Shu

238
00:19:01,310 --> 00:19:02,840
to set the record straight.

239
00:19:03,030 --> 00:19:03,640
What?

240
00:19:03,790 --> 00:19:05,450
Xie Shu is of commoner origin?

241
00:19:05,850 --> 00:19:08,200
Madam Hu shouted it out
right before she died,

242
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:09,590
right at the gate of the Xie family.

243
00:19:09,590 --> 00:19:10,790
Many people heard it.

244
00:19:10,830 --> 00:19:12,350
She was the Head Madam of the Xie family.

245
00:19:12,350 --> 00:19:13,750
Could her words be false?

246
00:19:14,030 --> 00:19:14,930
No wonder.

247
00:19:15,030 --> 00:19:16,270
Xie Shu never looked like someone

248
00:19:16,270 --> 00:19:17,870
with ancestral blessings.

249
00:19:17,960 --> 00:19:20,160
Turns out he is just a cuckoo in the nest.

250
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:22,570
This is outrageous!

251
00:19:22,680 --> 00:19:24,790
A hypocrite who abandoned his real name

252
00:19:24,790 --> 00:19:26,200
actually relied on deception

253
00:19:26,200 --> 00:19:27,480
to hold a high position for years.

254
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:27,880
He...

255
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:29,960
He even put on an act
to lead the prominent families.

256
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:31,440
This is a disgrace!

257
00:19:33,480 --> 00:19:35,350
Xie Shu is audacious.

258
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:38,400
How dare he impersonate the son
of the Xie family for so many years.

259
00:19:38,400 --> 00:19:40,260
He deserves death for his crimes.

260
00:19:40,480 --> 00:19:42,390
How dare a fake put on airs

261
00:19:42,480 --> 00:19:44,160
and try to command the prominent families
of Hengtang?

262
00:19:44,160 --> 00:19:46,270
How could
the prominent families spare him?

263
00:19:46,270 --> 00:19:48,480
By letting a person of unknown origin

264
00:19:48,640 --> 00:19:50,110
hold important posts

265
00:19:50,510 --> 00:19:51,880
and command a region,

266
00:19:52,030 --> 00:19:53,830
it's a big disgrace to our court.

267
00:19:53,960 --> 00:19:55,620
How can the people be at peace?

268
00:19:56,030 --> 00:19:57,830
This matter must be
thoroughly investigated

269
00:19:57,830 --> 00:19:59,680
to give everyone an explanation.

270
00:19:59,680 --> 00:20:01,790
And to give us prominent families
an explanation.

271
00:20:01,790 --> 00:20:02,400
Everyone.

272
00:20:02,880 --> 00:20:04,680
We should quickly submit a joint petition

273
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:05,750
to the Emperor

274
00:20:06,100 --> 00:20:07,960
to ask the Emperor
to look into this clearly

275
00:20:07,960 --> 00:20:09,720
and severely punish this imposter.

276
00:20:09,720 --> 00:20:10,440
Otherwise,

277
00:20:10,680 --> 00:20:12,010
we will never accept it.

278
00:20:12,070 --> 00:20:13,160
But over the years,

279
00:20:13,790 --> 00:20:16,320
Hengtang's tax revenues
have been abundant.

280
00:20:17,680 --> 00:20:18,740
Pass down my order.

281
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:20,350
This matter is of great consequence.

282
00:20:20,350 --> 00:20:22,280
I will investigate it thoroughly.

283
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:23,510
As for Xie Shu,

284
00:20:24,070 --> 00:20:26,270
I'll wait and see how he'll deal with it.

285
00:20:26,350 --> 00:20:28,010
If he can prove his innocence,

286
00:20:28,070 --> 00:20:29,350
or give an explanation,

287
00:20:29,350 --> 00:20:32,010
there might still be room
to turn things around.

288
00:20:32,880 --> 00:20:33,480
Yes.

289
00:20:34,230 --> 00:20:36,710
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

290
00:20:40,510 --> 00:20:42,700
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

