Jin Chunqing

578
00:37:23,280 --> 00:37:25,270
is my own child.

579
00:37:27,960 --> 00:37:29,000
So what?

580
00:37:31,670 --> 00:37:33,110
For the Xie family,

581
00:37:34,320 --> 00:37:35,720
if I had to sacrifice her,

582
00:37:36,590 --> 00:37:37,850
then I sacrificed her.

583
00:37:45,800 --> 00:37:47,360
What you want to know,

584
00:37:47,840 --> 00:37:49,370
I have told you everything.

585
00:37:49,880 --> 00:37:51,880
I used to be Lu Lingshu,

586
00:37:54,110 --> 00:37:55,440
and I also used to be

587
00:37:56,710 --> 00:37:58,510
your mother's mother.

588
00:38:00,320 --> 00:38:01,820
But Lu Lingshu

589
00:38:02,710 --> 00:38:04,110
is long gone.

590
00:38:04,670 --> 00:38:06,230
And I, Xie Chengyuan,

591
00:38:07,510 --> 00:38:09,170
have absolutely nothing to do

592
00:38:11,110 --> 00:38:13,510
with you, Chen Qingyuan.

593
00:38:14,400 --> 00:38:15,800
I won't implicate you.

594
00:38:20,840 --> 00:38:22,150
I just wanted...

595
00:38:25,190 --> 00:38:26,280
to see you again.

596
00:38:31,190 --> 00:38:32,840
I've said all I needed to say.

597
00:38:34,510 --> 00:38:35,510
You may leave.

598
00:38:37,920 --> 00:38:38,670
Is that so?

599
00:38:41,800 --> 00:38:43,710
If you are truly

600
00:38:44,630 --> 00:38:46,830
as heartless and resolute as you claim,

601
00:38:49,550 --> 00:38:51,410
why did you tuck the copper mirror

602
00:38:53,110 --> 00:38:55,170
into my mother's swaddling clothes?

603
00:38:55,280 --> 00:38:56,030
Your name

604
00:38:56,760 --> 00:38:57,880
is hidden in it.

605
00:38:58,670 --> 00:39:00,070
Weren't you just hoping

606
00:39:01,440 --> 00:39:02,480
that one day

607
00:39:04,190 --> 00:39:05,550
you could meet again?

608
00:39:06,920 --> 00:39:08,780
Also, I remember when I was young,

609
00:39:10,070 --> 00:39:11,190
there was a lord

610
00:39:12,550 --> 00:39:14,840
who always secretly helped us.

611
00:39:15,590 --> 00:39:17,320
If you really forgot about her,

612
00:39:18,030 --> 00:39:19,430
then how can this longing

613
00:39:19,920 --> 00:39:21,030
be explained?

614
00:39:24,840 --> 00:39:25,960
Old Madam Xie?

615
00:39:28,110 --> 00:39:29,150
Lu Lingshu?

616
00:39:34,760 --> 00:39:36,630
Or should I call you...

617
00:39:39,670 --> 00:39:40,630
Grandmother?

618
00:39:47,840 --> 00:39:51,230
Actually, I've been
silently watching Chunqing.

619
00:39:52,070 --> 00:39:53,920
Watching her grow up,

620
00:39:54,320 --> 00:39:57,360
watching her graceful figure on the stage,

621
00:39:58,150 --> 00:40:00,640
I was happier than anyone else.

622
00:40:02,510 --> 00:40:03,480
Back then,

623
00:40:05,510 --> 00:40:06,640
was Mom's encounter

624
00:40:07,510 --> 00:40:08,840
with Xie Shu

625
00:40:10,880 --> 00:40:12,140
really a coincidence?

626
00:40:14,670 --> 00:40:15,360
No.

627
00:40:18,480 --> 00:40:20,000
It was destiny.

628
00:40:24,880 --> 00:40:27,110
Xie Shu's friend, Shen Zhibai,

629
00:40:27,400 --> 00:40:28,930
loved listening to operas.

630
00:40:29,000 --> 00:40:30,000
That day,

631
00:40:30,230 --> 00:40:32,670
he dragged Xie Shu to watch a play.

632
00:40:32,920 --> 00:40:34,750
Little did they know, this trip

633
00:40:35,000 --> 00:40:36,760
would forge an ill-fated relationship

634
00:40:36,760 --> 00:40:38,230
between Chunqing

635
00:40:38,440 --> 00:40:39,980
and Xie Shu.

636
00:40:40,910 --> 00:40:43,050
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

637
00:40:43,070 --> 00:40:45,140
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

638
00:40:49,590 --> 00:40:51,190
Sure enough, not long after,

639
00:40:51,590 --> 00:40:52,760
the two of them

640
00:40:52,840 --> 00:40:54,000
fell in love.

641
00:40:55,590 --> 00:40:57,710
After discovering they were in love,

642
00:40:58,360 --> 00:41:01,560
I went from being terrified to hesitant.

643
00:41:02,110 --> 00:41:05,920
Gradually, I even looked forward to it.

644
00:41:08,480 --> 00:41:09,190
Chunqing.

645
00:41:10,150 --> 00:41:10,920
Look.

646
00:41:11,590 --> 00:41:13,910
That's the inner household library.

647
00:41:14,280 --> 00:41:19,480
Later, Xie Shu told me
he wanted to marry Chunqing.

648
00:41:20,190 --> 00:41:21,760
I was thrilled.

649
00:41:22,360 --> 00:41:25,710
I thanked God for using this way

650
00:41:25,800 --> 00:41:29,760
to bring Chunqing back to me.

651
00:41:37,840 --> 00:41:39,070
Greetings, Mother.

652
00:41:43,400 --> 00:41:44,280
Chunqing,

653
00:41:45,400 --> 00:41:46,400
you're back.

654
00:41:48,030 --> 00:41:49,320
Welcome back.

655
00:41:50,360 --> 00:41:51,150
From now on,

656
00:41:52,880 --> 00:41:54,600
this is your home.

657
00:41:59,280 --> 00:42:00,590
Thank you, Mother.

658
00:42:02,430 --> 00:42:04,950
[Danyue Pavilion]

659
00:42:03,550 --> 00:42:05,630
I wanted to doubly compensate her.

660
00:42:05,030 --> 00:42:07,820
[Fuyu Pavilion]

661
00:42:06,590 --> 00:42:10,710
So I gave
the best Danyue Pavilion to Chunqing.

662
00:42:11,710 --> 00:42:13,510
I wanted to keep her safe.

663
00:42:16,000 --> 00:42:17,190
But, what a pity.

664
00:42:17,840 --> 00:42:19,280
Soon, Xie Shu

665
00:42:19,550 --> 00:42:21,550
was favored by Eunuch Xia

666
00:42:20,660 --> 00:42:22,730
[Jingmu Hall]

667
00:42:21,550 --> 00:42:23,750
and was promoted to work in the capital.

668
00:42:24,030 --> 00:42:26,880
And Xia Yingying,
forced upon us by Eunuch Xia,

669
00:42:27,550 --> 00:42:28,850
pushed all of this

670
00:42:29,280 --> 00:42:30,840
to ruin.

671
00:42:32,500 --> 00:42:34,710
[Jingmu Hall]

672
00:42:37,630 --> 00:42:39,030
-If you have any complaints...
-Chunqing.

673
00:42:39,030 --> 00:42:39,920
You can...

674
00:42:40,030 --> 00:42:40,680
Shut up!

675
00:42:44,710 --> 00:42:46,510
The concubines in the residence

676
00:42:46,510 --> 00:42:47,830
hated Xia Yingying

677
00:42:48,030 --> 00:42:49,670
deeply.

678
00:42:49,760 --> 00:42:51,160
But towards Chunqing,

679
00:42:51,280 --> 00:42:52,670
they were jealous.

680
00:42:53,280 --> 00:42:54,830
After Xia Yingying died,

681
00:42:55,190 --> 00:42:58,440
Hu Wenzhuo's brother,
working under Eunuch Xia,

682
00:42:58,670 --> 00:43:01,880
began investigating the matter.

683
00:43:02,320 --> 00:43:05,400
The outcome would definitely
be unfavorable to Chunqing.

684
00:43:05,400 --> 00:43:06,360
So,

685
00:43:06,360 --> 00:43:09,070
I made a deal with the Hu family

686
00:43:09,550 --> 00:43:12,590
to let Chunqing leave the Xie Residence.
